WEBVTT

00:05:30.246 --> 00:05:35.329
As the estate seller yelled out,
"Cash and carry,"

00:05:35.329 --> 00:05:38.746
I told her, "You can't do that,
not with this."

00:05:39.246 --> 00:05:45.663
A local university had offered
3,000 dollars for the entire collection.

00:05:45.996 --> 00:05:47.829
I told her, "Please give it to me.

00:05:47.871 --> 00:05:49.746
Honestly, I'll take it and preserve it.

00:05:49.746 --> 00:05:51.663
These are family heirlooms."

00:05:52.538 --> 00:05:55.204
She told me it would be
a quarter of a million dollars.

00:05:55.579 --> 00:05:57.871
A quarter of a million dollars?

00:05:57.913 --> 00:05:59.496
I don't have that.